url: "https://github.com/RViMLab/segment-anything-annotator-v2"
abstract: >-
  A cross-platform desktop application for Segment Anything Model-assisted
  pixel-level image annotation and resumable expert review of
  Labelme-compatible polygon annotations. It supports polygon editing,
  review decisions, active-time tracking, provenance, annotation change
  detection, resumable SQLite storage, and CSV audit export.
keywords:
  - image annotation
  - annotation review
  - Segment Anything Model
  - semantic segmentation
  - computer vision
  - medical imaging
  - expert review
  - audit trail
